                        "glosses": [
                            "By serendipity; by blind luck in combination with wisdom; by fortunate accident."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "31821d49-f18a-4789-bd2a-61e351a71817",
                                "sense_id": "bbfe405a-b7fc-376c-b89e-e5b89c087dd5",
                                "text": "And that was a few years before the serendipitously named American politician Anthony Weiner reminded us once again that a high-powered job is no guarantee of knowing what to do with your penis, through his \"sexting\" use of Twitter (Snapchat hadn't been invented yet.)"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9b8103cb-5c5b-4742-bb31-ab975f737192",
                                "sense_id": "bbfe405a-b7fc-376c-b89e-e5b89c087dd5",
                                "text": "And then unexpectedly, and serendipitously, Mr. Trump won the White House. Ending legal abortion appeared within their reach."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
